wh40k-class-specialization-warrior-bastion-name = Adamantine Bastion
wh40k-class-specialization-warrior-bastion-description = Shields, heavy armor, holding NPC attention, and protecting allies.

wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-01-name = Shield Oath
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-01-description = Unlocks the defensive stance; a shield and heavy armor become the foundation of this branch.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-02-name = Iron Posture
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-02-description = Reduces knockback and stamina loss while holding position.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-03-name = Reinforced Plates
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-03-description = Moderately improves equipped armor without creating a separate layer of armor from nothing.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-04-name = Unyielding Wall
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-04-description = The shield withstands frontal hits better and loses durability more slowly.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-05-name = Battle Cry
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-05-description = Marks nearby hostile NPCs to prioritize the Warrior. Requires a server-side threat system.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-06-name = Bodyguard
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-06-description = Opens a short window to intercept a strike or projectile intended for a nearby ally.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-07-name = Steel Resolve
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-07-description = Reduces stamina damage buildup at low health without making the player immortal.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-08-name = Brace Shield
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-08-description = A fixed stance with stronger frontal defense but restricted movement and attacks.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-09-name = Retaliatory Shove
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-09-description = A successful block has a controlled chance to stagger the attacking NPC or player.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-10-name = Challenge the Champion
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-10-description = Designates one NPC as a personal target: it tries to attack the Warrior, who gains defense only against it.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-11-name = Squad Bulwark
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-11-description = Allies behind the Warrior gain limited cover from frontal fire.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-12-name = Unbroken
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-12-description = The first critical-state transition within an interval grants a brief survival window instead of immediately losing the line.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-13-name = Guardian's Step
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-13-description = A quick dash to an ally that enables interception rather than an offensive charge.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-14-name = Reactive Armor
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-14-description = Protects against one powerful hit on an internal cooldown.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-15-name = Siege Line
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-15-description = Holding position improves the shield and battle cry, but aggressive movement removes the effect.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-16-name = Contempt for Pain
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-16-description = Temporarily reduces injury penalties without negating damage or healing.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-17-name = Punishing Barrier
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-17-description = A successful series of blocks creates a brief pressure zone before the shield that pushes NPCs away.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-18-name = Standard Bearer
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-18-description = Group allies near the Warrior lose stability more slowly; multiple Warriors do not stack this effect.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-19-name = Last Stand
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-19-description = Briefly makes the Warrior the primary NPC focus and greatly improves frontal defense on a long cooldown.
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-20-name = Living Fortress
wh40k-class-skill-warrior-bastion-20-description = Final node: improves every defensive action in the branch through one controlled modifier without stacking hidden bonuses.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorBattleCry = Battle cry
    .desc = Draws the attention of nearby hostile NPCs in direct line of sight.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorBodyCover = Bodyguard
    .desc = Intercept part of a selected ally's damage during a short window.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorShieldBrace = Brace shield
    .desc = Fix the shield in place for stronger defense at the cost of movement and attacks.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorChallengeChampion = Challenge the champion
    .desc = Force a selected hostile NPC to focus on the Warrior.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorGuardianStep = Guardian's step
    .desc = Physically dash to an ally along a clear path and enable interception.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorPunishingBarrier = Punishing barrier
    .desc = Create a brief NPC pressure area before the shield.
ent-ActionWh40kWarriorLastStand = Last stand
    .desc = Draw nearby NPC focus during a decisive defensive window.
